{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/des_header.png?t=1745530786\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead Station Files is a turn\u2011based roguelike about surviving on a doomed space station, experienced entirely through the logs of EVACOM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Events and crew narratives are captured as EVACOM data files, recorded by each character from their perspective. Load any file to live through that crew member\u2019s final run and stitch together the full picture of the catastrophe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catastrophe via EVACOM:\u00a0</strong>The entire experience plays out through the EVACOM terminal\u2019s archived logs, letting you relive the station\u2019s disaster firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/station_screen.gif?t=1745530786\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every level is generated 100% solveable puzzle:</strong> Extract from every level on your way, deck by deck, untill it's too late.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/levels.gif?t=1745530786\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-based tactics:</strong> Plan your moves, avoid deadly threats, and manage limited resources under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/First_gameplay.gif?t=1745530786\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Death is part of the process:</strong> Death is not the end - it's another step forward. Each defeat brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/Station_Death.gif?t=1745530786\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every action matters:</strong> Stories in the files Unlock new characters and piece together the events through their personal records. Reading logs is the key to understanding what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/Station_gameplay.gif?t=1745530786\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687410?t=1745530786","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/1adc6c58b6ae584df87683f4c23930e140747ae8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745530786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/9ae3cbc8914cf187acc3dfe2215400385eb7751a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745530786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/9ae3cbc8914cf187acc3dfe2215400385eb7751a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745530786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains realistic depictions of blood, though they are infrequent and not the primary focus.\r\nPlayers may encounter scenes involving the implied death of characters, often represented through schematic visuals and atmospheric audio.\r\nThe narrative explores themes of isolation, survival, and catastrophic failure in a sci-fi horror setting.\r\nWhile there is no graphic violence or gore, the tone is tense and may not be appropriate for all players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sh